From: Producdevity
Subject: [PATCH] wsi/display: preserve timeout results across C11 waits

The monotonic condition helper returns thrd_timedout. Display acquisition and
display-event fence waits expect ETIMEDOUT and otherwise report a surface or
device failure. Translate only the timeout result at their shared wait helper.

--- a/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_display.c
+++ b/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_display.c
@@ -2185,6 +2185,9 @@
    };
 
    int ret = u_cnd_monotonic_timedwait(cond, mutex, &abs_timeout);
+   /* WSI wait callers recognize errno ETIMEDOUT rather than the C11 result. */
+   if (ret == thrd_timedout)
+      ret = ETIMEDOUT;
    wsi_display_debug("%9ld done waiting for event %d\n", pthread_self(), ret);
    return ret;
 }
